This repository includes files derived from Herdr (https://herdr.dev), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- packages/spaces-sidebar/mods/spaces-sidebar/main.js is a modified copy of Herdr's `spaces` mod
  (version 0.1.18). It adds folders to the sidebar.
- packages/mark-agents-unread/mods/mark-agents-unread/main.js is a modified copy of Herdr's `agents` mod
  (version 0.1.18). It lets an idle agent be marked unread.
- packages/file-explorer/mods/file-explorer/main.js is a modified copy of Herdr's `files` mod
  (version 0.1.18). It adds file type icons, a right-click menu and drag to move.
- packages/hide-names/mods/tabs-names/main.js, packages/hide-names/mods/pane-names/main.js, packages/hide-names/mods/hide-names/main.js
  and packages/hide-names/mods/toast-names/main.js are modified copies of Herdr's
  `tabs`, `pane`, `workspace-status` and `toast` mods (version 0.1.18). They draw made-up names while names are hidden; the
  pane-names and tabs-names icons are unmodified copies of those mods' icons.
- layouts/herdr-powertools.json is a modified copy of Herdr's `main` layout
  (version 0.1.18). Its Spaces block shows `spaces-sidebar` instead of `spaces`,
  its Agents block shows `mark-agents-unread` instead of `agents`, and its Files
  block shows `file-explorer` instead of `files`. Its Changes block shows
  `git-panel` instead of `changes`. It also has two blocks of its own for
  `project-search`: the Search panel, and one that only takes a key. Its tab
  bar, pane headers and status bar show `tabs-names`, `pane-names` and
  `hide-names`, and its notifications are drawn by `toast-names`.

The optional native indent-guide patch changes the Apache-2.0 gpui-base editor
from longbridge/gpui-kit as vendored in Herdr 0.1.18.

The full layout also includes Back and forward from PostHog/herdr and Quick
Actions from dougcunha/herdr-mods. Each is distributed under its MIT license
in the corresponding mod folder.

Spotify Mini adapts the macOS notification listener from
jeffarese/herdr-spotify. Its MIT license is included in
packages/spotify-mini/mods/spotify-mini/LICENSE.
The Spotify wordmark and its icon are Spotify trademarks. The player logo
comes from https://developer.spotify.com/documentation/design.

This repository also includes the icons of Material Icon Theme
(https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme, version
5.40.0), which is licensed under the MIT License:

- packages/file-explorer/mods/file-explorer/icons/*.svg are unmodified copies of its icons, and
  packages/file-explorer/mods/file-explorer/icons/map.js is generated from its manifest. Its license
  is in packages/file-explorer/mods/file-explorer/icons/LICENSE.
